    <comment>Accepted prefixes for starting a named stopwatch from Home, separated by |. A name follows the prefix.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Parsing.EndTimePattern" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>^(?:(?&lt;name&gt;.*?)\s+)?(?:until|at)\s+(?&lt;time&gt;.+)$</value>
    <comment>End-time query regex. Translate keywords and word order, preserving named captures "name" (optional timer name) and "time" (local clock time). Keep word boundaries for alphabetic keywords. Uses .NET non-backtracking syntax: no lookarounds or backreferences. English syntax remains available.</comment>
  </data>
